  'polokwane-100-day-service-delivery-programme-launched-2026-11-27',
  'Polokwane Municipality starts 100-day push on water, roads and streetlights',
  'Community', '2026-11-27', 'Review Online', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/11/27/100-days-to-prove-it-polokwane-municipality-targets-service-delivery-fixes/',
  'Polokwane Municipality launched a 100-day service delivery programme on 27 November, with set targets for water, roads, streetlights and waste.',
  'Polokwane Municipality''s new administration launched a 100-day service delivery programme on Friday, 27 November, at the New Council Chambers. Mayor John Mpe was returned for a second term earlier in the week. Councillors will provide political oversight while municipal officials carry out the work.

On water, the programme lists six rural supply projects meant to reach 1,442 households, plus the installation of 1,500 smart water meters to cut losses. Jacaranda FM reports that projects are planned in areas including Moletjie, Matlala, Molepo, Maja, Chuene and Mankweng.

For roads, the municipality plans to repair 9,978 square metres of surface, grade 500 km of road spread over seven clusters, and put new surfacing on 5.2 km. It also aims to restore 3,500 streetlights that are not working, with 1,000 fixed in the first 30 days, and to install 43 solar-powered high mast lights.

Other commitments include weekly refuse collection in every cluster, the clearing of 100 illegal dumping sites and vegetation clearing at 150 public open spaces and parks. The municipality also plans to hire 100 unemployed graduates and 71 traffic and by-law enforcement officers.

According to the timeline reported, interventions start by Day 15, at least 70% of projects should be finished by Day 70 and all of them by Day 100. A progress report is then due to council and the public. Residents can keep reporting faults to the municipality, which says it will give meaningful feedback.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/11/27/100-days-to-prove-it-polokwane-municipality-targets-service-delivery-fixes/", "https://www.jacarandafm.com/news/news/john-mpe-returns-as-polokwane-mayor/"]',
  'agent'
);
